{"seq":28,"slug":"browser-extension-development","title":"浏览器扩展开发","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 浏览器扩展开发\n\n浏览器扩展是运行在浏览器内、却又游走于网页与浏览器内核之间的一类特殊程序。它既能像普通网页那样用 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 构建界面，又能调用一组普通网页拿不到的特权 API——读写标签页、拦截网络请求、长期保存数据、在任意站点注入脚本。这种\"半特权\"身份决定了扩展开发既熟悉又陌生：熟悉在语言与工具链，陌生在它独有的进程模型、生命周期、权限边界与商店审核约束。\n\n这个 hub 按\"地基→构件→管线→落地\"的顺序，把扩展开发拆成四章层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基。先用一张架构图讲清扩展由哪些彼此隔离的部分组成、它们各自跑在什么进程里；再深入到清单文件 Manifest V3——这是每个扩展的身份证与配置中枢，2024 年起 Chrome 已彻底淘汰 Manifest V2，理解 V3 的服务工作线程模型与远程代码禁令是一切的前提；最后讲权限模型，它既是扩展能力的开关，也是用户信任与商店审核的核心关切。\n\n第二章「组件」讲构件。扩展的三大可执行单元各司其职：内容脚本活在网页里负责操作 DOM，后台 Service Worker 是无界面的事件中枢，UI 界面（弹窗、侧栏、选项页）是用户直接交互的门面。三者进程隔离、互不直接调用，这正引出第三章。\n\n第三章「能力与通信」讲管线。隔离的组件之间靠消息通信串起来；跨生命周期的状态靠存储 API 沉淀；而扩展真正的\"特权\"，则通过 tabs、scripting、alarms、declarativeNetRequest 等浏览器能力 API 释放出来。\n\n第四章「工程实践」讲落地收口。一份代码要跑在 Chrome、Firefox、Safari、Edge 上需要跨浏览器适配；面对网页这个充满敌意的环境要守住安全与隐私底线；最终还要通过商店审核才能到达用户。这一章把前三章的知识收束成可发布的产品。\n\n四章之间不是平行的知识点堆叠，而是一条从\"理解扩展是什么\"到\"做出能发布的扩展\"的完整路径。每一篇文档只深讲属于自己的那块，遇到别处主讲的概念便一句话点到并交叉链接过去，让整个 hub 成网而非成岛。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"extension-architecture","title":"扩展架构总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/foundations/extension-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"manifest-v3","title":"Manifest V3 清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/foundations/manifest-v3"},{"seq":3,"slug":"permissions-model","title":"权限模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/foundations/permissions-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"components","title":"组件","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/components","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"content-scripts","title":"内容脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/components/content-scripts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"background-service-worker","title":"后台 Service Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/components/background-service-worker"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ui-surfaces","title":"UI 界面：弹窗、侧栏与选项页","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/components/ui-surfaces"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"apis","title":"能力与通信","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/apis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"messaging","title":"消息通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/apis/messaging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"storage-state","title":"存储与状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/apis/storage-state"},{"seq":3,"slug":"browser-apis","title":"浏览器能力 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/apis/browser-apis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-browser","title":"跨浏览器兼容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/practice/cross-browser"},{"seq":2,"slug":"security-privacy","title":"安全与隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/practice/security-privacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"publishing-store","title":"发布与商店审核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-extension-development/practice/publishing-store"}]}]}